units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
lattice bcc 3.3
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132
region projectile block 0 66 0 66 133.5 199.5
region whole union 2 target projectile
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
mass 1 92.90637
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
velocity all create 300 87287 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
group projectile region projectile
velocity projectile set 0 0 -2000 units box
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 100000
unfix 1
fix 2 all nve
run 200000
